{"speciesId":137,"names":{"fr":"Porygon","es":"Porygon","en":"Porygon","ja":"ポリゴン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"A POKéMON that consists entirely of programming code. Capable of moving freely in cyberspace."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"A POKéMON that consists entirely of programming code. Capable of moving freely in cyberspace."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"The only POKéMON people anticipate can fly into space. None has managed the feat yet, however."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It is a manmade POKéMON. Since it doesn't breathe, people are eager to try it in any environment."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"A manmade POKéMON that came about as a result of re­ search. It is pro­ grammed with only basic motions."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"An artificial POKéMON created due to extensive research, it can perform only what is in its program."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"PORYGON is capable of reverting itself entirely back to program data and entering cyberspace. This POKéMON is copy-protected so it cannot be duplicated by copying."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"PORYGON is capable of reverting itself entirely back to program data and entering cyberspace. This POKéMON is copy-protected so it cannot be duplicated by copying."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It is capable of reverting itself entirely back to program data in order to enter cyberspace. A PORYGON is copy- protected so it cannot be duplicated."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Using the most advanced technologies, scientists finally succeeded in making the first artificial POKéMON."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"A POKéMON that consists entirely of programming code. It is capable of moving freely in cyberspace."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"The world’s first artificially created Pokémon. It can travel through electronic space."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"The world’s first artificially created Pokémon. It can travel through electronic space."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"A man-made Pokémon created using advanced scientific means. It can move freely in cyberspace."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It is a manmade Pokémon. Since it doesn’t breathe, people are eager to try it in any environment."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"A manmade Pokémon that came about as a result of research. It is programmed with only basic motions."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ce Pokémon créé par des scientifiques peut arpenter librement le cyberespace."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"A man-made Pokémon created using advanced scientific means. It can move freely in cyberspace."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ce Pokémon créé par des scientifiques peut arpenter librement le cyberespace."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"A man-made Pokémon created using advanced scientific means. It can move freely in cyberspace."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"A man-made Pokémon created using advanced scientific means. It can move freely in cyberspace."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"A man-made Pokémon created using advanced scientific means. It can move freely in cyberspace."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Un Pokémon créé par l’homme après de longues recherches. Il ne connaît que peu de mouvements."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Pokémon creado por el hombre tras muchas investigaciones. Sus habilidades son básicas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"A man-made Pokémon that came about as a result of research. It is programmed with only basic motions."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"研究の末 生み出された 人工の ポケモン。基本的な 動作しか プログラムされていない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ce Pokémon est fait de programmes et d’algorithmes. Il peut survivre en milieu virtuel."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Un Pokémon formado por códigos de programación. Se mueve libre por el ciberespacio."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"A Pokémon that consists entirely of programming code. It is capable of moving freely in cyberspace."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"体が プログラムで できている。 電子空間を 自由自在に 移動できる 能力を持つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Porygon est capable de se décompiler et de retourner à l’état de programme informatique pour entrer dans le cyberespace. Ce Pokémon est protégé contre le piratage, il est donc impossible de le copier."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Porygon es capaz de convertirse otra vez en datos informáticos y de entrar en el ciberespacio. Tiene protección anticopia, así que es imposible duplicarlo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Porygon is capable of reverting itself entirely back to program data and entering cyberspace. This Pokémon is copy protected so it cannot be duplicated by copying."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"全身を プログラム データに 戻して 電子 空間に 入る ことが できる。 コピーガードされて いるので コピー できない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Porygon est capable de se décompiler et de retourner à l’état de programme informatique pour entrer dans le cyberespace. Ce Pokémon est protégé contre le piratage, il est donc impossible de le copier."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Porygon es capaz de convertirse otra vez en datos informáticos y de entrar en el ciberespacio. Tiene protección anticopia, así que es imposible duplicarlo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Porygon is capable of reverting itself entirely back to program data and entering cyberspace. This Pokémon is copy protected so it cannot be duplicated by copying."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"全身を プログラム データに 戻して 電子 空間に 入る ことが できる。 コピーガードされて いるので コピー できない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Un Pokémon artificiel créé il y a vingt ans en utilisant des méthodes à la pointe de la technologie de l’époque."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Un Pokémon que fue creado por el hombre hace unos 20 años con los medios tecnológicos que había disponibles en aquel momento."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Roughly 20 years ago, it was artificially created, utilizing the latest technology of the time."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"およそ ２０年前に 当時の 科学力を 結集し 生みだされた 人工の ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il peut transformer son corps en données numériques pour pénétrer dans le cyberespace."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Porygon es capaz de convertirse en datos informáticos y de entrar en el ciberespacio."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It can convert its body into digital data, which enables it to enter cyberspace."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"身体を デジタルデータ化 することが できるので 電脳空間に 入り込むことが できるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Un Pokémon artificiel créé il y a vingt ans, et qui est donc complètement dépassé sur bien des points."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Fue creado por el hombre unos 20 años atrás con los medios del momento, por lo que ahora está desfasado en muchos aspectos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"This Pokémon was created using the cutting-edge science of 20 years ago, so many parts of it have since become obsolete."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"約２０年前の 科学力で 生み出された ポケモンなので 今や 時代遅れな 部分も 多い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il a été conçu il y a vingt ans par des chercheurs qui rêvaient de conquérir l’espace. Ce rêve n’est toujours pas devenu réalité."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Fue creado hace 20 años por un grupo de científicos que soñaba con explorar el espacio. Dicho sueño aún no se ha cumplido."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It was built 20 years ago by scientists who dreamed of exploring space. Their dreams have yet to come true."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"２０年前 宇宙を 夢見た 科学者たちに よって 作られた。 未だ その夢は 叶っていない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Ce Pokémon est censé être le seul à pouvoir voler jusque dans l’espace, mais pour l’instant, aucun Porygon n’y est jamais parvenu."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Se creía que sería el único Pokémon capaz de volar por el espacio, pero aún no se ha visto a ninguno que lo haya conseguido."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"The only Pokémon that people anticipate can fly into space. None has managed the feat yet, however."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"唯一 宇宙まで 飛んでいける ポケモンと 期待 されているが 未だに 成功例は ない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Ce Pokémon est censé être le seul à pouvoir voler jusque dans l’espace, mais pour l’instant, aucun Porygon n’y est jamais parvenu."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Se creía que sería el único Pokémon capaz de volar por el espacio, pero aún no se ha visto a ninguno que lo haya conseguido."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"The only Pokémon that people anticipate can fly into space. None has managed the feat yet, however."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"唯一 宇宙まで 飛んでいける ポケモンと 期待 されているが 未だに 成功例は ない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"C’est le premier Pokémon au monde à avoir été créé à partir de programmes informatiques, grâce à une technologie de pointe."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Se trata del primer Pokémon del mundo creado a partir de códigos de programación gracias al uso de tecnología de vanguardia."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"State-of-the-art technology was used to create Porygon. It was the first artificial Pokémon to be created via computer programming."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"最高の 科学力を 使い 世界で はじめて プログラムにより 作られた 人工の ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ces dernières années, il s’est rendu très utile dans le cyberespace, qu’il arpente pour s’assurer qu’il n’y a aucune donnée suspecte."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Durante los últimos años, ha estado muy activo en el ciberespacio comprobando que no haya datos sospechosos."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"In recent years, this species has been very helpful in cyberspace. These Pokémon will go around checking to make sure no suspicious data exists."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"近年は 電脳空間で 大活躍。 怪しい データが ないか チェックして まわっている。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"It has no discernible heartbeat and does not seem to draw breath, and yet it appears to function without issue. I cannot even begin to explain this utterly bizarre anomaly."}],"varieties":[{"id":137,"moves":[{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[19,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[1,"level-up",1],[2,"level-up",1],[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[19,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[24,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1],[28,"level-up",1],[29,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[28,"machine",0],[29,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[25,"level-up",50],[25,"machine",0],[28,"machine",0],[29,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-beam","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[4,"tutor",0],[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[19,